# The address a remote machine (a host added over SSH) uses to reach this
# server's API. It must be reachable from that
# machine, so never localhost. Empty = FRONTEND_BASE_URL. Test connection
# fetches <this>/health/live from the host and refuses an add it cannot reach.
# ALKERA_NODE_API_URL=
# The model gateway a remote machine's chats go through, reachable from it.
# Empty = ALKERA_NODE_API_URL + /gateway, the web proxy's route to this
# server's own gateway (ALKERA_GATEWAY_UPSTREAM on the web image). Test
# connection fetches <this>/health/live from the host too.
# ALKERA_NODE_GATEWAY_URL=
# ALKERA_NODE_SANDBOX_REQUIRED=gvisor
# SANDBOX_TIER_FREE_VCPU=1
